  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\">환상의 빛 상자 키트를 만들어 보셨죠<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\">포장지를 넣은 <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">A4 </span>화일케이스  <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span>개 정도와 크리스마스 트리 전구를 준비하면</p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\">여러 가지 방법으로 이용할 수 있어요<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span>인천과학대제전에서 <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">ENJOY “SCIENCE”</span>를 만들어 부스를 꾸몄더니 꽤 반응이 괜찮았어요<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  </span>어떤 분은 집에서 생일축하나 크리스마스때 직접 만들어 보겠다고 하셨어요<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span>자유학기 동아리 수업시간에도 학생들에게 과학에 대해 생각나는 것을 <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;\">OHP </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;\">필름에 네임펜으로 꾸며보라고 했어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;\">. </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;\">학생들은 물음표</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;\">나침반</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;\">과학샘</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;\">블랙홀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;\">, SHARE </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;\">등 다양하게 표현한 결과물에 만족하였고 그렇게 생각하는 이유를 발표했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"0\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2264623C585731B223\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\" data-filename=\"c5aUd0151w06logmmad0m_7e11ta.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2264623C585731B2230382\"/></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"0\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/277BC03C585731B214\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"1024\" data-filename=\"e20Ud0151ory1pblvu134_7e11ta.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_277BC03C585731B2146A5D\"/></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"0\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/226D883C585731B31E\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"791\" data-filename=\"SHARE.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"791\"  id=\"A_226D883C585731B31E57A5\"/></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"0\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2564543C585731B324\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"908\" data-filename=\"경량샘.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"908\"  id=\"A_2564543C585731B324B174\"/></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"0\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/226F953C585731B31E\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"879\" data-filename=\"블랙홀.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"879\"  id=\"A_226F953C585731B31E6222\"/></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"0\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2279933C585731B416\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"997\" data-filename=\"인천과학대제전.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"997\"  id=\"A_2279933C585731B41692A0\"/></p><p class=\"0\">장점은 한번 만들어 놓으면 계속 사용할 수 있다는 것입니다<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"0\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22596848585731F523\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"434\" data-filename=\"sf.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"434\"  id=\"A_22596848585731F523F7F6\"/></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
